~ start
Mr Pencil: Hey you
- Me?
	Mr Pencil: Yes you
	
Mr Pencil: You're a wondering witch right?
- Yes how did you know?
	Mr Pencil: Let's just say you dress quite expressively

Mr Pencil: If you can't already tell from my clothes, I'm acutally from the future
- Am I going to be rich in the future
	Mr Pencil: It doesn't work like that
	
- Why are you here?
Mr Pencil: My memories have been cloudy ever since I've been here
Mr Pencil: The last thing I can recall was a portal and all of my energy being drained out of me
- Bro that sounds rough are you okay?
	Mr Pencil: Yes
- Do you need my help?
Mr Pencil: I heard that the monsters around here drop energy stones when defeated, maybe you could help me collect some?
- Sure thing
Mr Pencil: Please help me collect 3 energy stones from the potato monsters.
=> END

~ repeat
Mr Pencil: Please help me collect 3 energy stones from the potato monsters.
=> END

~ snipet
Mr Pencil: Come back later
=> END

~ finished
Mr Pencil: Wow this is amazing, thank you so much
Mr Pencil: Here is 100 coins as a reward, make sure to buy something from the market

- What the cauldron do?
	Mr Pencil: Ah yes the cauldron
	Mr Pencil: If you stand within a specific area around the cauldron, you will regain all your health and special points
	Mr Pencil: You can also interact with it to brew potions that can assist you in battle
	Mr Pencil: Once brewed, those potion will show up in your inventory
	
- This is a lot of money are you sure?
	Mr Pencil: No please accept it, thanks to you I can potentially return home now


- Is there anything else I can help with?
	Mr Pencil: Not at the moment
Mr Pencil: I'm going to be putting these energy stones to get use now
Mr Pencil: Come back later
=> END
